      "setup": "needs",
      "states": [
        {
          "buttons": [
            {
              "action": {
                "action": {
                  "finish": "metallic",
                  "kind": "layer.setFinish",
                },
                "kind": "studio.activeLayer",
              },
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "command.0",
              "label": "Try Metallic",
              "primary": false,
              "role": "command",
            },
            {
              "action": "next",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.next",
              "label": "Next",
              "primary": true,
              "role": "nav",
            },
          ],
          "content": {
            "body": "The finish picker now shows the finishes that go into your mod first. **Matte**, **Satin** and **Metallic** can go into your mod. **Glossy** and **Colour-shifting** can be built as experiments. **Shimmer** and **Glitter** are being reworked and wait for a check in the game, so the picker shows them only with **Show research tools** on (Settings › Appearance). A layer that already uses one keeps it.",
            "title": "Finishes that go into your mod",
          },
          "count": 4,
          "first": true,
          "index": 0,
          "last": false,
          "placement": "auto",
          "step": 0,
          "target": {
            "anchor": "finish.picker",
            "kind": "anchor",
          },
          "tour": "whats-new-0.1.0-beta.1",
          "waiting": false,
        },
        {
          "buttons": [
            {
              "action": "back",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.back",
              "label": "Back",
              "primary": false,
              "role": "nav",
            },
            {
              "action": "next",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.next",
              "label": "Next",
              "primary": true,
              "role": "nav",
            },
          ],
          "content": {
            "body": "**Add preset** now starts with a layer, like your first preset, so there's something to shape straight away. **Save as new collection** gives the copy its own name, and the Library panel lists your **Recent drafts** to bring any of them back.",
            "title": "New presets start ready",
          },
          "count": 4,
          "first": false,
          "index": 1,
          "last": false,
          "placement": "auto",
          "step": 1,
          "target": {
            "anchor": "presets.list",
            "kind": "anchor",
          },
          "tour": "whats-new-0.1.0-beta.1",
          "waiting": false,
        },
        {
          "buttons": [
            {
              "action": {
                "kind": "panel",
                "panel": "package",
              },
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "command.0",
              "label": "Open Mod package",
              "primary": false,
              "role": "command",
            },
            {
              "action": "back",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.back",
              "label": "Back",
              "primary": false,
              "role": "nav",
            },
            {
              "action": "next",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.next",
              "label": "Next",
              "primary": true,
              "role": "nav",
            },
          ],
          "content": {
            "body": "**Build** makes your mod for a feminine and a masculine V: the masculine character creator gets its own row with the same looks. The masculine row hasn't been tried in the game yet; **What's not in this version yet** in Help lists what's still to check.",
            "title": "For a masculine V too",
          },
          "count": 4,
          "first": false,
          "index": 2,
          "last": false,
          "placement": "auto",
          "step": 2,
          "target": {
            "anchor": "header.package",
            "kind": "anchor",
          },
          "tour": "whats-new-0.1.0-beta.1",
          "waiting": false,
        },
        {
          "buttons": [
            {
              "action": "back",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.back",
              "label": "Back",
              "primary": false,
              "role": "nav",
            },
            {
              "action": "finish",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.finish",
              "label": "Done",
              "primary": true,
              "role": "nav",
            },
          ],
          "content": {
            "body": [
              "This is a beta, and your reports make it work on more setups. **Report a problem…** in Help prepares a report you review first; nothing is sent by itself. XF Studio tells you when a newer version is out; **Check for updates** in Help looks now.",
              "",
              "Every tour, including this one, is in **Help** ([[key:shell.help]]).",
            ],
            "title": "Tell us what doesn't work",
          },
          "count": 4,
          "first": false,
          "index": 3,
          "last": true,
          "placement": "auto",
          "step": 3,
          "target": {
            "anchor": "header.help",
            "kind": "anchor",
          },
          "tour": "whats-new-0.1.0-beta.1",
          "waiting": false,
        },
      ],
      "tour": "whats-new-0.1.0-beta.1",
      "writable": false,
