          "content": {
            "body": [
              "The **Character** panel holds your V's character-creator options, read from your game and mods.",
              "",
              "- Load a save to see your own V.",
              "- Change any option to try your looks on another face, and save a set of options as a preset.",
              "",
              "None of this changes your looks or your save.",
            ],
            "title": "Your V",
          },
          "count": 4,
          "first": true,
          "index": 0,
          "last": false,
          "placement": "auto",
          "step": 0,
