              "primary": true,
              "role": "nav",
            },
          ],
          "content": {
            "body": [
              "**Camera & light** frames the view and lights your V. Choose a lighting setup, such as **Character creator** to compare with the game, or make your own and aim its lights with the direction dial.",
              "",
              "Camera and light never change your looks or your mod.",
            ],
            "title": "Camera & light",
          },
          "count": 4,
          "first": false,
          "index": 1,
