          "content": {
            "body": [
              "In a few minutes you'll make **two eye makeup looks**, build them into your own **XF Eye Artistry** mod and add it to your game, ready to try in the character creator.",
              "",
              "Where a step is fiddly, **Do it for me** does it for you, Colour, finish and layer edits can be undone. Adding a preset works like **Add preset**: remove it from the Presets list if you no longer want it; the removal offers Restore. The two looks are added to the collection you have open; nothing you already made is changed.",
            ],
            "title": "Your first eye makeup mod",
          },
