          "content": {
            "body": [
              "When your looks are ready, open **Mod package**.",
              "",
              "- **Check** lists which looks can become mod files, and names anything that would be left out and why. It needs no game files.",
              "- **Build** makes the mod files. **Add to my mod manager** adds them to your game when you choose to.",
