              "action": "next",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.next",
              "label": "Next",
              "primary": true,
              "role": "nav",
            },
          ],
          "content": {
            "body": [
              "XF Studio needs to know where your game and mod manager are before it can build your mod. The **Game** card here says the one thing to do next, with a button where it can.",
              "",
              "**Settings › Game** holds the rest. Once the card says it's ready, this tour carries on by itself.",
            ],
            "title": "One thing first: your game and mod manager",
          },
          "count": 9,
          "first": false,
          "index": 7,
          "last": false,
          "placement": "auto",
          "step": 8,
          "target": {
            "anchor": "package.setup",
            "kind": "anchor",
          },
          "tour": "first-eye-mod",
          "waiting": false,
        },
        {
          "buttons": [
            {
              "action": "back",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.back",
              "label": "Back",
              "primary": false,
              "role": "nav",
            },
            {
              "action": "finish",
              "capability": {
                "available": true,
              },
              "id": "nav.finish",
              "label": "Done",
              "primary": true,
              "role": "nav",
            },
          ],
          "content": {
            "body": [
              "Start the game (through Mod Organizer 2, if you use it) and open the character creator.",
              "",
              "- Among the head options, near the eye makeup, there's a new row labelled **XF**. The mod itself is called XF Eye Artistry.",
              "- Its choices are **Off** and your two looks, named as in your Presets list.",
              "- Choose each look and check the eyes show the colour, shape and finish you made.",
              "",
              "If the row isn't there: [[help:install|Installing your mod]] in Help.",
              "",
              "The masculine V row is not yet game-tested.",
            ],
            "title": "What to check in the game",
          },
          "count": 9,
          "first": false,
          "index": 8,
          "last": true,
          "placement": "auto",
          "step": 11,
          "target": {
            "kind": "none",
          },
          "tour": "first-eye-mod",
          "waiting": false,
        },
      ],
      "tour": "first-eye-mod",
      "writable": true,
