              "- Hold **Shift** and drag to rotate, or Shift-wheel to scale.",
              "- The wheel zooms and right-drag pans. [[key:uv.fit]] fits the shape.",
              "",
              "Try moving a point. [[key:shell.undo]] takes any change back.",
